# Hutchinson delay equation: Hopf at r=pi/2, period 4 there
# Script (new in XPPAUT 8.4): hutch-try.xps, run with File -> Do script
# (keys F D) or the Scripts menu: an AUTO sweep over three starting values
# of r that carries on when a pass has no Hopf point ("try ... else ...
# end"), with the periodic orbits from each Hopf point found. Its messages
# appear in the bottom line of XPP's window.
par r=1.8
x'=r*x*(1-delay(x,1))
init x=1.2
@ total=300,trans=295.8164662,dt=0.01,delay=2,meth=rungekutta
@ xlo=0,xhi=300,ylo=0,yhi=3,maxstor=100000
@ parmin=0.5,parmax=2.6,autoxmin=0.5,autoxmax=2.6,autoymin=0,autoymax=6
done
